stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Idle
    state "尚未检查" as Idle
    state "检查前置条件" as Prerequisites
    state "下载与构建" as Building
    state "离线自检" as Verifying
    state "提交与发布" as Publishing
    state "本次准备成功" as Ready
    state "失败或取消" as Failed
    Idle --> Prerequisites: 准备 / 修复
    Prerequisites --> Building: 新候选且持锁
    Prerequisites --> Verifying: 复用已发布环境
    Prerequisites --> Failed: 缺工具 / 坏记录 / 忙
    Building --> Verifying: 候选与收据落盘
    Building --> Failed: 失败 / 取消
    Verifying --> Publishing: 实际自检通过
    Verifying --> Failed: 失败 / 取消
    Publishing --> Ready: 正常退出且重读匹配
    Publishing --> Failed: I/O / 回复丢失 / 取消
    Ready --> Prerequisites: 显式复查 / 修复
    Failed --> Prerequisites: 显式重试
    note right of Building
      V27 安装阶段
      发布前保留旧 active
      安装不启动设备
    end note
    note right of Failed
      先等待进程清理
      commit 后可能已发布
      重读 active 确认事实
    end note
